{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1740,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is like the world's most important freezer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6020,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is. Really. *laughs*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8560,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most important room in the world, someone has said."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12060,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are pretty big claims for a place located"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15040,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just 1300 km, or 800 miles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17900,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the north pole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19260,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then, this is no ordinary place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22400,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the Svalbard Global Seed Vault."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25440,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, actually, this is just it's front door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28800,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inside the seed vault are a series of tunnels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31800,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not actually that cold right here, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33780,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as we go deeper, it is only going to get colder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39100,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is Bente"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40580,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're an engineer, Bente?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41620,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I am"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42120,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you gonna show us where to go?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43540,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*chuckles* Yeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44220,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fantastic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45840,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many doors are there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48800,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One, two, three, four, five doors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51460,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until we are into the secret room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54020,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Five doors to the secret room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60020,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Woah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60900,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what I'm talking about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63160,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the lenghts of tunnel that take you down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66000,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the seed vault."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67120,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This facility was built to last around 200 years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70140,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and withstand earthquakes and explosions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72880,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was placed on the side of a mountain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74820,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so even if all the ice on earth melts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76800,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will still be above sea level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79440,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are three separate vault rooms where seeds are stored"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82540,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but only one of them is in use right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84660,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's buried over 120 meters from the front door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88740,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The whole point of putting the vaults so deep in this mountain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92000,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to put it within permafrost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94560,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, all around me, the earth naturally stays"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98180,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around -4 or -5 all year round."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101900,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, that way, if something did happen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the cooling stopped flowing here, there was no power."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108400,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, well, behind these doors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111200,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would still remain probably, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113880,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-4 or -5 Celsius, forever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117120,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Assuming, of course, global temperatures don't rise that much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120340,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This place is sometimes called \"The Doomsday Vault\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123640,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because even in a worst case scenario"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125660,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it should preserve the diversity of the world's food crops."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128820,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we are really in the mountain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131060,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Surrounded by permafrost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134080,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, here's a cross tunnel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137040,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that leads to three vault doors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139280,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vault number 1 is up there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141440,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vault number 2,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142720,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is the one that is actually being used."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145080,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, vault number 3."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148580,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's pretty amazing to look up and see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152500,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ice covered ceilings and walls everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155980,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Svalbard Global Seed Vault works essentially like a bank vault?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159960,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, it's almost, yeah, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161720,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the seeds lay in the boxes like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165140,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These boxes are sealed when they come to Svalbard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167860,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And none of us can open it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171000,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We put it through the security system at the airports"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174120,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just to check that it isn't any explosives or anything in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177980,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it works like a bank box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180580,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can't open this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182100,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only the depositor can open and take out their seeds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185400,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you don't open any of the seeds, any of the boxes that come here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189100,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189680,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well. How do you know that people are really deposing the seeds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192640,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like barely they say they are not, and other things?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195360,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just because they have signed the contract. That's it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198140,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can't be sure about it. Of course, we trust them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201680,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would there be seeds for some crops that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205220,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people might consider illicit, like marijuana"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206980,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is said that that shall not be in here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209340,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No drugs and also no gene-modified material"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213940,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No genetically modified seeds go in here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216400,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, Norway has asked for that no genetical material is kept in here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221200,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are there any particularity strange crops?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223160,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Has anyone deposited anything that is really odd or weird?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226680,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ahhh.. No, nothing weird is in here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232020,
    "dDurationMs": 6900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but we get some questions from people that wants to put in their own private seeds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238920,
    "dDurationMs": 7300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've also has had letters from men wanting to put their gene material in here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246680,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is really strange and we don't answer those."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250740,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the door to the vault and behind here, there are nearly a million different varieties of seeds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256680,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from all over the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258300,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kept at minus 18 degrees Celsius."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265120,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know how I can tell that it's minus 18°C in here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268520,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can actually feel the moisture in your nose freeze so,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272840,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your nostrils get all stiff..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275260,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275760,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I see behind you we have some Canadian seeds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278760,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is exciting for me because I am Canadian."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281240,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what sort of things do we have... From Canada,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284640,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm really not... Not sure because... This box... On the outside doesn't tell what's in it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290600,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291460,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These numbers here are connected to a database on the internet so you can go in there afterwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297360,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: There you go.  Bente: Yeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299360,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can go find out what has Canada got stored in the Seed Vault."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303400,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are we looking at right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305220,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a bank vault except everything that you've put in there is publicly available."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309800,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it is. (chuckles)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311900,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the coolest boxes I think. They are from North Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315060,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Oh my goodness!                                                                         Bente: Wooden hand made boxes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318420,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: They look like they come from the 1960s or something. Do you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322460,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bente: Yeah, they do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322960,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: They built them specially."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324960,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bente: They built them specially because they got the measurements of how big should the boxes be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329600,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and these are built exactly of those measurements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332800,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here you see that North Korea is placed on the same shelf as USA, it's just on the back there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338400,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's on the back side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339160,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you have South Korea, just on the back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342020,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here there are like in a small United Nations, deep in the mountains of Svalbard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347520,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Chuckles)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349520,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these are the last few bare shelves in Vault 2."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356000,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once the other two vaults are full, there will be around 3 million different species of plants stored here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362040,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with over 500 seeds per sample."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364620,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one day, there may be over a billion seeds stored inside this mountain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368960,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "representing the vast majority of Earth's agricultural diversity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372640,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you don't know today what kind of seeds that you can grow in 20, 30, 40 years from now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379520,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because of the climate change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380720,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perhaps you have to use another type of seed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384840,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thirty years from now that can handle warmer climate, dryer climate, wetter climate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whatever is going to happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394320,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that is why it's so important to have a backup of all the seeds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399020,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that you are sure that you can also grow the food we need,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403160,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the next generations to come."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405160,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this isn't the only seed bank on Earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408120,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are around 1700 other gene banks around the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411580,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "run by different countries and organizations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414560,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, at a cost of $9 million to build the Svalbard seed vault"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418420,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and millions more to run it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419700,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's worth asking whether this is a costly redundancy, or a valuable insurance policy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425880,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And perhaps, the best people to answer this question are the Syrians, who, last year, were the first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431080,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make a withdrawal from the seed vault."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433080,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The gene bank in Aleppo, in Syria, is now out of order, it's been bombed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437920,
    "dDurationMs": 7300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one third of the material that is kept in here is now taken down to Morocco and Lebanon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445220,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is some of the material that now has been returned, so to get the material going again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's why it's empty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452400,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Will those seeds actually be used to grow crops?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455820,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, they will. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457620,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the last 13 thousand years we have cultivated millions of species of plants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462880,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The agricultural revolution underpinned the technological and population explosions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467340,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that made our modern lives possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470220,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The risk of a real Doomsday scenario is incredibly remote."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474100,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, whatever happens, thanks to this outpost at the top of the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478340,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least our seeds are safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485700,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, I'm currently on a train traveling from Washington, D.C. to New York City so I can't talk to loud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491620,
    "dDurationMs": 7080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually after Norway, I went to Seoul, South Korea, Los Angeles, Boston , New York and Washington,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498700,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's been some crazy travels for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500940,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on all these travels I've been listening to audio books from Audible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504980,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who also support Veritasium which I am very thankful for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508300,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you didn't know already, Audible has like 250,000 titles in all areas of literature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513000,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including fiction, non-fiction and periodicals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515540,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you go to Audible.com/veritasium you can get a 30 day free trial of the website"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you can just try out listening to a book."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522320,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you are at all interested in listening to audio books, I highly recommend you check them out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526300,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is a book I can recommend to you, it is my favorite fiction book of all time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530120,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's called \"Everything is Illuminated\" by Jonathon Safran Foer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533400,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is-  I don't know, its just such a complex interwoven novel, you have to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540280,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "read it or listen to it to know what i mean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543160,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you can check it out. You can download that book for free for a one month trial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547120,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or you can pick any other book of your choosing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549120,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I really want to thank Audible for supporting me and helping me go to all these amazing places."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553400,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I want to thank you for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
